<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopian military drones have entered Sudan, prompting formal complaints from Sudan at the UN and the African Union, while RSF drones are being launched from Ethiopian territory against Sudanese targets. In northern Ethiopia, WHO warns the health system is near collapse as attacks on civilians continue, including an RPG strike near a school in Moyale that killed 60 Ethiopian Orthodox believers and forced Kenya to register over 50,000 Ethiopian refugees. Sudan has accused Ethiopia of allowing RSF drone launches, and both countries have shut each other's consulates. The conflict caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261105-ethiopian-families-fleeing-conflict-face-difficulties-with-food-access&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxNc1N1NjlSa05wVFlyS1MtcnNUVktKRjlrSDI3TW5wQ1RadVRYNHFJNzdOS2ZRZGw4S1dDa0xJVl9OM2N6QXhFa0psWnFrQzF6aUhUMXZtS283V3NfUC1qdm92MjRBVUlWSGIyRGd2NENwaEFpNUlVSVVVX2ZNZEFxUl9lVUktaVZPQmZ1TC1obXJoWGszUVFBSlZBc3ZaNXFPeW1zZGVjZ3h3ckVwUzdyc0s5UDRSUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE5CVGVJZm1aalQwN2hISm5maXhReGZydjRYdHp3VHB6dklkX3poaDA3aDBEcU5XODZWcXhzVjhvSTg2b2JrbFlkSDM1LTUtd0NFR2dGV2NyYUY?oc=5&quot;&gt;AFP Fact Check&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE9rWUhrcTV0Rkc0TGlsUGN6NGpwZmsxYXF1aXNIQUJGM09QRjZKeWdnZVJfd2F0X21GWEZTVEZrc0NPR09MS2RaQ1JMcVR2NDdpcWIzeUJ6SHdMMThtekE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.goo